<title>ITALY: Banca Pop Milano posts H1 profit up 51 pct.</title>
<headline>Banca Pop Milano posts H1 profit up 51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banca Popolare Milano SpA said it posted first half 1996 net profit of 127.1 billion lire against 84.1 billion lire in the first six months of 1995.</p>
<p>The bank gave the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
